# GraphKAN AMO NQS — Stage 4B Control Gate

This is a self-contained Stage 4B audit-response code package for a controlled N=8 open-chain Rydberg neural-quantum-state study. It contains only the runnable Stage 4B path, native Stage 4B result schemas, a dual sample/exact health policy, per-run checkpoints, and control-sweep configurations.

**Current status:** internal research control gate. This repository does not support claims of KAN superiority, Graph-KAN performance, geometry transfer, finite-size scaling, or manuscript readiness.

Read `STAGE_4B_README.md` before running experiments.
